@startuml sd_us215
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US215 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "NetworkController" as NetworkController
participant "CalculateTotalNetworkDistanceUseCase" as CalculateTotalNetworkDistanceUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
== GET /api/network/total-distance ==
Actor -> EAR : GET /api/network/total-distance\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> NetworkController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
NetworkController -> CalculateTotalNetworkDistanceUseCase : execute(...)
CalculateTotalNetworkDistanceUseCase -> DBAR : own routes
CalculateTotalNetworkDistanceUseCase -> PAR : GET /internal/replicas/routes\n(every peer in parallel)
PAR --> CalculateTotalNetworkDistanceUseCase : their routes
CalculateTotalNetworkDistanceUseCase -> CalculateTotalNetworkDistanceUseCase : keep the latest change of each record,\nleave out deleted ones; filter, compute, sort, page
CalculateTotalNetworkDistanceUseCase --> NetworkController : result
NetworkController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id; X-Partial-Result if both holders of a record were unreachable)
@enduml
